#: xml_doc.cc:2781 xml_doc.cc:2784 xml_doc.cc:2787 xml_doc.cc:2790
#: xml_doc.cc:2793
#, no-c-format
msgid "Boolean values"
msgstr "Бомантиқи маъно"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 51
#: xml_doc.cc:2688
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The AND() function returns True if all the values are true. Otherwise it "
"returns False."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи AND(), агар тамоми параметрҳо ҳақиқӣ бошанд (вагарна он False-ро бар "
"мегардонад), True-ро бар мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 52
#: xml_doc.cc:2691
#, no-c-format
msgid "AND(value;value;...)"
msgstr "AND(маъно;маъно;...)"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 53
#: xml_doc.cc:2694
#, no-c-format
msgid "AND(true;true;true) returns True"
msgstr "AND(дуруст;дуруст;дуруст) бозгаштан True"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 54
#: xml_doc.cc:2697
#, no-c-format
msgid "AND(true;false) returns False"
msgstr "AND(дуруст;нодуруст) бозгаштан False"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 82
#: xml_doc.cc:2715
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The OR() function returns True if at least one of the values is true. Otherwise "
"it returns False."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи OR(), агар ҳатто як параметр ҳақиқӣ бошад (вагарна он False-ро бар "
"мегардонад), True-ро бар мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 83
#: xml_doc.cc:2718
#, no-c-format
msgid "OR(value;value;...)"
msgstr "OR(маъно;маъно;...)"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 84
#: xml_doc.cc:2721
#, no-c-format
msgid "OR(false;false;false) returns False"
msgstr "OR(false;false;false) бозгаштан False"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 85
#: xml_doc.cc:2724
#, no-c-format
msgid "OR(true;false) returns True"
msgstr "OR(true;false) бозгаштан True"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 113
#: xml_doc.cc:2742
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The NAND() function returns True if at least one value is not true. Otherwise "
"it returns False."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи NAND(), агар ҳатто як параметр ҳақиқӣ набошад (вагарна он False-ро бар "
"мегардонад), True-ро бар мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 114
#: xml_doc.cc:2745
#, no-c-format
msgid "NAND(value;value;...)"
msgstr "NAND(маъно;маъно;...)"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 115
#: xml_doc.cc:2748
#, no-c-format
msgid "NAND(true;false;false) returns True"
msgstr "NAND(true;false;false) бозгаштан True"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 116
#: xml_doc.cc:2751
#, no-c-format
msgid "NAND(true;true) returns False"
msgstr "NAND(true;true) бозгаштан False"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 144
#: xml_doc.cc:2769
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The NOR() function returns True if all the values given as parameters are of "
"boolean type and have the value false. Otherwise it returns False."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи NOR(), агар ҳамаи параметрҳо аҳамияти мантиқии нодуруст бошанд, "
"True-ро бар мегардонад. Вагарна он False-ро бар мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 145
#: xml_doc.cc:2772
#, no-c-format
msgid "NOR(value;value;...)"
msgstr "NOR(маъно;маъно;...)"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 146
#: xml_doc.cc:2775
#, no-c-format
msgid "NOR(true;false;false) returns False"
msgstr "NOR(true;false;false) бозгаштан False"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 147
#: xml_doc.cc:2778
#, no-c-format
msgid "NOR(false;false) returns True"
msgstr "NOR(false;false) бозгаштан True"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 175
#: xml_doc.cc:2796
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The XOR() function returns True if the number of True values is even. Otherwise "
"it returns False."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи XOR(), агар миқдори параметрҳо бо аҳамияти ҳақиқатан ҷуфт бошанд "
"(вагарна он False-ро бар мегардонад), True-ро бар мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 176
#: xml_doc.cc:2799
#, no-c-format
msgid "XOR(value;value;...)"
msgstr "XOR(value;value;...)"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 177
#: xml_doc.cc:2802
#, no-c-format
msgid "XOR(false;false;false) returns True"
msgstr "XOR(false;false;false) бозгаштан True"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 178
#: xml_doc.cc:2805
#, no-c-format
msgid "XOR(true;false) returns False"
msgstr "XOR(true;false) бозгаштан False"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 186
#: xml_doc.cc:2808
#, no-c-format
msgid "Boolean value"
msgstr "Бомантиқи маъно"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 190
#: xml_doc.cc:2811
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The NOT() function returns True if the value is False and returns False if the "
"value is True."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи NOT(), агар параметри False, False-ро бар гардонад(агар аҳамият True "
"бошад), True-ро бар мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 191
#: xml_doc.cc:2814
#, no-c-format
msgid "NOT(bool)"
msgstr "NOT(бомантики талабот)"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 192
#: xml_doc.cc:2817
#, no-c-format
msgid "NOT(false) returns True"
msgstr "NOT(false) бозгаштан True"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 193
#: xml_doc.cc:2820
#, no-c-format
msgid "NOT(true) returns False"
msgstr "NOT(true) бозгаштан False"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 201
#: xml_doc.cc:2823
#, no-c-format
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "Мазмун"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 205
#: xml_doc.cc:2826
#, no-c-format
msgid "If true"
msgstr "агар дуруст"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 209
#: xml_doc.cc:2829
#, no-c-format
msgid "If false"
msgstr "агар нодуруст"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 213
#: xml_doc.cc:2832
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The IF() function is a conditional function. This function returns the second "
"parameter if the condition is True. Otherwise it returns the third parameter."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи IF(), функсияи дастур мебошад. Он параметри дуввумро мавриди иҷрои "
"дастур (вагарна он параметри саввумро бар мегардонад), бар мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 214
#: xml_doc.cc:2835
#, no-c-format
msgid "IF(condition;if_true;if_false)"
msgstr "IF(талабот;дар ҳақиқат; дар иҷро накардандро талабот)"

#. i18n: file extensions/logic.xml line 215
#: xml_doc.cc:2838
#, no-c-format
msgid "A1=4;A2=6;IF(A1>A2;5;3) returns 3"
msgstr "A1=4;A2=6;IF((A1>A2;5;3) бозгаштан 3"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 5
#: xml_doc.cc:2841
#, no-c-format
msgid "Math"
msgstr "Риёзи"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 11
#: dialogs/kspread_dlg_formula.cc:56 xml_doc.cc:2844
#, no-c-format
msgid "Function"
msgstr "Функсия"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 15
#: xml_doc.cc:2847 xml_doc.cc:3090 xml_doc.cc:3105 xml_doc.cc:3177
#: xml_doc.cc:3192 xml_doc.cc:3228 xml_doc.cc:3243 xml_doc.cc:3258
#: xml_doc.cc:3267 xml_doc.cc:3282 xml_doc.cc:3297 xml_doc.cc:3315
#: xml_doc.cc:3333 xml_doc.cc:3351 xml_doc.cc:3369 xml_doc.cc:3384
#, no-c-format
msgid "Values"
msgstr "Маъноҳо"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 19
#: xml_doc.cc:2850
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The SUBTOTAL() function returns a subtotal of a given list of arguments "
"ignoring other subtotal results in there. Function can be one of the following "
"numbers: 1 - Average, 2 - Count, 3 - CountA, 4 - Max, 5 - Min, 6 - Product, 7 - "
"StDev, 8 - StDevP, 9 - Sum, 10 - Var, 11 - VarP."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи SUBTOTAL(), зернатиҷаи рӯйхати аҳамияти дода шударо, ки дигар "
"аҳамиятҳои зернатиҷаро дар ин рӯйхат ба эътибор намегирад, бар мегардонад. "
"Функсияҳои зернатиҷот: 1 - Average, 2 - Count, 3 - CountA, 4 - Max, 5 - Min, 6 "
"- Product, 7 - StDev, 8 - StDevP, 9 - Sum, 10 - Var, 11 - VarP."

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 20
#: xml_doc.cc:2853
#, no-c-format
msgid "SUBTOTAL(function; value)"
msgstr "SUBTOTAL(функсия; маъно)"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 21
#: xml_doc.cc:2856
#, no-c-format
msgid "If A1:A5 contains 7, 24, 23, 56 and 9:"
msgstr "Агар диапазони А1:А5 маънои нигоҳ доштан 7, 24, 23, 56 ва 9:"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 22
#: xml_doc.cc:2859
#, no-c-format
msgid "SUBTOTAL(1; A1:A5) returns 23.8"
msgstr "SUBTOTAL(1; A1:A5) бозгаштан 23.8"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 23
#: xml_doc.cc:2862
#, no-c-format
msgid "SUBTOTAL(4; A1:A5) returns 56"
msgstr "SUBTOTAL(4; A1:A5) бозгаштан 56"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 24
#: xml_doc.cc:2865
#, no-c-format
msgid "SUBTOTAL(9; A1:A5) returns 119"
msgstr "SUBTOTAL(9; A1:A5) бозгаштан 119"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 25
#: xml_doc.cc:2868
#, no-c-format
msgid "SUBTOTAL(11; A1:A5) returns 307.76"
msgstr "SUBTOTAL(11; A1:A5) бозгаштан 307.76"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 44
#: xml_doc.cc:2871 xml_doc.cc:2892 xml_doc.cc:2916
#, no-c-format
msgid "First number"
msgstr "Рақами якум"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 48
#: xml_doc.cc:2874 xml_doc.cc:2895 xml_doc.cc:2919
#, no-c-format
msgid "Second number"
msgstr "Рақами дуюм"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 52
#: xml_doc.cc:2877
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The LCM() function returns the least common multiple for two or more float "
"values"
msgstr ""
"Функсияи LCM(), адади томи тақсимшавандаи хурди умумиро барои ду ва ё зиёда "
"ададҳои шайъӣ низ бар мегардонад"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 53
#: xml_doc.cc:2880
#, no-c-format
msgid "LCM(value; value)"
msgstr "LCM(маъно; маъно)"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 54
#: xml_doc.cc:2883
#, no-c-format
msgid "LCM(6;4) returns 12"
msgstr "LCM(6;4) бозгаштан 12"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 55
#: xml_doc.cc:2886
#, no-c-format
msgid "LCM(1.5;2.25) returns 4.5"
msgstr "LCM(1.5;2.25) бозгаштан 4.5"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 56
#: xml_doc.cc:2889
#, no-c-format
msgid "LCM(2;3;4) returns 12"
msgstr "LCM(2;3;4) бозгаштан 12"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 73
#: xml_doc.cc:2898 xml_doc.cc:2922
#, no-c-format
msgid "Third number"
msgstr "Рақами сеюм"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 77
#: xml_doc.cc:2901
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The GCD() function returns the greatest common denominator for two or more "
"integer values."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи GCD(), махраҷи умумии калонтаринро барои ду ва ё зиёда аҳамиятҳои "
"бутун низ бар мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 78
#: xml_doc.cc:2904
#, no-c-format
msgid "GCD(value; value)"
msgstr "GCD(маъно; маъно)"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 79
#: xml_doc.cc:2907
#, no-c-format
msgid "GCD(6;4) returns 2"
msgstr "GCD(6;4) бозгаштан 2"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 80
#: xml_doc.cc:2910
#, no-c-format
msgid "GCD(10;20) returns 10"
msgstr "GCD(10;20) бозгаштан 10"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 81
#: xml_doc.cc:2913
#, no-c-format
msgid "GCD(20;15;10) returns 5"
msgstr "GCD(20;15;10) бозгаштан 5"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 102
#: xml_doc.cc:2925
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The LCD() function returns the largest common denominator for two or more "
"integer values."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи LCD(), махраҷи умумии калонтаринро барои ду ва ё зиёда аҳамиятҳои "
"бутун низ бар мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 103
#: xml_doc.cc:2928
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This function is obsolete and will be removed in a later version of KSpread. It "
"is provided only for compatibility. Please use the GCD function instead."
msgstr ""
"Ин функсияи қадима мебошад ва аз дигар равандҳои KSpread хориҷ карда мешавад. "
"Ҳоло он танҳо барои мувофиқ буданаш мондааст. Функсияи GCD-ро истифода кунед."

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 104
#: xml_doc.cc:2931
#, no-c-format
msgid "LCD(value; value)"
msgstr "LCD(маъно; маъно)"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 112
#: xml_doc.cc:2934
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"EPS() returns the machine epsilon; this is the difference between 1 and the "
"next largest floating-point number. Because computers use a finite number of "
"digits, roundoff error is inherent (but usually insignificant) in all "
"calculations."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи EPS(), аҳамияти эпсилонро - фарқи байни 1 ва адади калонтарини бо "
"нуқтаи шиноварро бар мегардонад. Чанде компютерҳо мақодири номаҳдуди ишораҳоро "
"барои намоиши ададҳо истифода мекунанд, доирашакл кардан қисми ҷудоинопазирии "
"(аммо ҷузъӣ) ҳисобкунӣ низ мебошад."

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 113
#: xml_doc.cc:2937
#, no-c-format
msgid "EPS()"
msgstr "EPS()"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 114
#: xml_doc.cc:2940
#, no-c-format
msgid "On most systems, this returns 2^-52=2.2204460492503131e-16"
msgstr ""
"Дар бисёри қисми системаҳо, ин функсия 2^-52=2.2204460492503131e-16-ро бар "
"мегардонад"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 115
#: xml_doc.cc:2943
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"0.5*EPS() returns the \"unit round\"; this value is interesting because it is "
"the largest number x where (1+x)-1=0 (due to roundoff errors)."
msgstr ""
"0.5*EPS(), \"доирашакл кардани элемент\"-ро бар мегардонад.Ин аҳамият манфиатро "
"нишон медиҳад, чанде ин адади калонтарини x мебошад, ки (1+x)-1=0-ро (тахминан "
"аз барои маҳдудияти доирашакл кардан) қонеъ мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 116
#: xml_doc.cc:2946
#, no-c-format
msgid "EPS() is so small that KSpread displays 1+eps() as 1"
msgstr ""
"Бузургии EPS() чунон хурд аст, ки KSpread, 1+eps()-ро чун 1 намоиш медиҳад"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 117
#: xml_doc.cc:2949
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pick a number x between 0 and EPS(). Observe that 1+x rounds x to either 0 or "
"EPS() by using the equation (1+x)-1"
msgstr ""
"Адади x-ро дар фосилаи байни 0 ва EPS(), бигиред. Диққат кунед, ки аҳамияти "
"1+x, x-ро то 0 мудаввар мекунад ё EPS() бо формулаи (1+x)-1"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 133
#: xml_doc.cc:2958
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The POWER(x;y) function returns the value of x raised to the power of y."
msgstr "Функсияи POWER(x;y), адади x-ро ба дараҷаи y бар мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 134
#: xml_doc.cc:2961
#, no-c-format
msgid "POWER(value;value)"
msgstr "POWER(маъно;маъно)"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 135
#: xml_doc.cc:2964
#, no-c-format
msgid "POWER(1.2;3.4) equals 1.8572"
msgstr "POWER(1.2;3.4) баробар 1.8572"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 136
#: xml_doc.cc:2967
#, no-c-format
msgid "POWER(2;3) equals 8"
msgstr "POWER(2;3) баробар 8"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 153
#: xml_doc.cc:2976
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The POW(x;y) function returns the value of x raised to the power of y. It's the "
"same as POWER."
msgstr "Функсияи POWER(x;y), адади x-ро ба дараҷаи y бар мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 154
#: xml_doc.cc:2979
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "POW(value;value)"
msgstr "POWER(маъно;маъно)"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 155
#: xml_doc.cc:2982
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "POW(1.2;3.4) equals 1.8572"
msgstr "POWER(1.2;3.4) баробар 1.8572"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 156
#: xml_doc.cc:2985
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "POW(2;3) equals 8"
msgstr "POWER(2;3) баробар 8"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 169
#: xml_doc.cc:2991
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The EVEN() function returns the number rounded up to the nearest even integer."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи EVEN(), ададро то ҷуфти бутуни наздиктарин низ мудаввар мекунад."

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 170
#: xml_doc.cc:2994
#, no-c-format
msgid "EVEN(value)"
msgstr "EVEN(маъно)"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 171
#: xml_doc.cc:2997
#, no-c-format
msgid "EVEN(1.2) returns 2"
msgstr "EVEN(1.2) бозгаштан 2"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 172
#: xml_doc.cc:3000
#, no-c-format
msgid "EVEN(2) returns 2"
msgstr "EVEN(2) бозгаштан 2"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 189
#: xml_doc.cc:3009
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The TRUNC() function truncates a numeric value to a certain precision. If the "
"precision is omitted 0 is assumed."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи TRUNC(), аҳамияти ададиро то дақиқиятимуайян, мебурад. Агар дақиқият "
"ишора нашуда бошад, зимнан 0 дар назар дошта мешавад ва адади бутун бар хоҳад "
"гашт."

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 190
#: xml_doc.cc:3012
#, no-c-format
msgid "TRUNC(value; precision)"
msgstr "TRUNC(маъно;аниқи)"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 191
#: xml_doc.cc:3015
#, no-c-format
msgid "TRUNC(1.2) returns 1"
msgstr "TRUNC(1.2) бозгаштан 1"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 192
#: xml_doc.cc:3018
#, no-c-format
msgid "TRUNC(213.232; 2) returns 213.23"
msgstr "TRUNC(213.232; 2) бозгаштан 213.23"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 207
#: xml_doc.cc:3024
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The ODD() function returns the number rounded up to the nearest odd integer."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи ODD(), ададро то тоқи бутуни наздиктарин низ мудаввар мекунад."

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 208
#: xml_doc.cc:3027
#, no-c-format
msgid "ODD(value)"
msgstr "ODD(маъно)"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 209
#: xml_doc.cc:3030
#, no-c-format
msgid "ODD(1.2) returns 3"
msgstr "ODD(1.2) бозгаштан 3"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 210
#: xml_doc.cc:3033
#, no-c-format
msgid "ODD(2) returns 3"
msgstr "ODD(2) бозгаштан 3"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 228
#: xml_doc.cc:3042
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The MOD() function returns the remainder after division. If the second "
"parameter is null the function returns #DIV/0."
msgstr ""
"Функсияи MOD(), бақияро аз тақсими ададҳо, бар мегардонад. Агар параметри "
"дуввум ба 0 баробар бошад, функсия хатогии #DIV/0-ро бар мегардонад."

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 229
#: xml_doc.cc:3045
#, no-c-format
msgid "MOD(value;value)"
msgstr "MOD(маъно;маъно)"

#. i18n: file extensions/math.xml line 230
#: xml_doc.cc:3048
